[h2]Build 0.9.52[/h2]
[h3]Changed[/h3]
[list]
[*][b]Steam clouds[/b] are now drawn as rolling puffs of steam using the game's own particle system - the same batched drawing as fire smoke - so a room full of steam costs about as much as a small fire. Thicker steam puffs more often and more densely. Spreading, filling rooms and heating are unchanged.
[/list]
